Package: fvfmR
Type: Package
Title: FvFm Leaf Disc Fluorescence Analysis from R
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Josef", "Garen", role = "aut"),
    person("Pieter", "Arnold", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "pieter.arnold@anu.edu.au"),
    person("Kristine", "Crous", role = "aut")
  )
Description: R wrapper around the 'fvfmPy' Python package for semi-automated
    analysis of leaf disc fluorescence images from a Walz ImagingPAM
    fluorometer. Computes Fv/Fm = (Fm - Fo) / Fm for each leaf disc and returns
    the results as a data frame. The interactive 'fvfmPy' window is launched
    from R and the logged observations are returned to R when it is closed.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/garenj/fvfmR, https://github.com/garenj/fvfmPy
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    reticulate,
    utils
SystemRequirements: Python (>= 3.10), fvfmPy (>= 1.0.3)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
